<title>FINLAND: PONSSE SEES LOWER FULL-YEAR 1996 EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>PONSSE SEES LOWER FULL-YEAR 1996 EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest harvester maker Ponsse Oy said on Tuesday it expects its full-year 1996 earnings to be good but lower than in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The result is expected to remain good but to be below that of last year,&quot; Ponsse said in a statement with its January-August results.</p>
<p>Ponsse's full-year 1995 profit before extraordinary items, reserves and taxes was 55.9 million markka and in January-August, its profit fell to 23.5 million markka from 26.8 million.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
